    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR introduces runtime installation/loading of the Z3 native library for the `udb` Ruby gem as a step toward shipping a more self-contained, distributable gem, and adds CI coverage to validate the behavior across environments.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add a `Udb::Z3Loader` that can download/extract Z3 from GitHub releases and configure library paths before requiring the `z3` gem.\n- Add Z3-focused unit tests and wire them into existing regression test matrices plus a new cross-distro/platform GitHub Actions job.\n- Update the devcontainer image to stop installing `libz3-dev` and instead pre-install Z3 using the runtime loader.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 10 out of 11 changed files in this pull request and generated 8 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tools/test/regress-tests.yaml | Adds `z3` and `z3_loader` to the regression test matrix list. |\r\n| tools/test/regress-gh-template.yaml | Adds a dedicated GH job to run the gem’s Z3 tests across platforms/containers. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/test_z3_loader.rb | Adds unit tests for install dir selection, platform detection, and env path configuration. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/test_z3.rb | Adds unit tests for Z3 solver wrappers/terms/finite arrays. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/run.rb | Includes the new Z3 test files in the default udb gem test runner. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/z3_version.rb | Introduces a single “source of truth” constant for the Z3 version to fetch. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/z3_loader.rb | Implements runtime download/extract/install of Z3 and FFI load interception. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/z3.rb | Ensures Z3 is available via loader before `require \"z3\"`. |\r\n| bin/.container-tag | Bumps container tag to reflect devcontainer/build changes. |\r\n| .github/workflows/regress.yml | Adds the Z3 job and expands the udb unit-test matrix to include Z3 tests. |\r\n| .devcontainer/Dockerfile | Removes OS-level `libz3-dev` and pre-installs Z3 via the Ruby loader during image build. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
